          "notes": "reBAP is a published quarter-hourly settlement price for balance-group imbalances, not a fixed \u20ac/MWh trading fee. It can be positive or negative. The current paper model is day-ahead only and settles planned DA volumes at the DA clearing price, so no imbalance volume is simulated and no reBAP charge is applied. A live physical asset would face reBAP on residual imbalances."
